Discussion: OpenRune/OpenRune-Server#353

From our per-feature patches `12-quests-sheep-shearer-romeo-juliet` (in [`openrune/upstream/`](https://github.com/AlexPerrin/osrs-plugins-reverse/tree/main/openrune/upstream) of osrs-plugins-reverse), applied with `git am` on `main` (`1be5dfb5f`); commits kept as they are except for the `feat:`/`fix:` subject.

**Problem.** Sheep Shearer and Romeo & Juliet were not implemented, so Quest Helper and the quest list had nothing to track.

**Change.** Both quests on OpenRune's quest framework, with the OSRS progress varps Quest Helper reads:
- Sheep Shearer: varp 179 (`sheep`): 0 not started, 1 started, 1 + balls of wool handed in, 21 complete; Fred, The Thing and the hand-in.
- Romeo & Juliet: varp 144 (`rjquest`) with the OSRS stages 0-100; Romeo, Juliet, Father Lawrence, the Apothecary and the cadava potion.

Adds `QuestTalkFixture` (test fixture for dialogue-driven quest tests), which the other quest branches build on.

**Tests.** `SheepShearerInteractionTest`, `RomeoAndJulietInteractionTest` (`:content:quest:test`).

On this branch (Docker `eclipse-temurin:21`, upstream's `./gradlew`, a clean `freshCache` of main restored first, then `:or-cache:buildCache :or-cache:mergePluginGamevals`; `assemble test integration` in one run in a 4 GB container): cache build pass, `spotlessCheck` pass, `assemble test integration` pass, boot: Server ready in 8.458180081s.

Nothing was checked in game from this exact branch; in-game checks mentioned above were on our own server build (main's pin `9a8b338a8` plus these and our other patches).

**Data sources.** Step values from Quest Helper (BSD) and the cache's quest dbrows. The patch does not record where each dialogue line came from; some of it may follow the wiki transcripts.

**Caveats.**
- Overlaps #299 (Romeo & Juliet, open upstream). Happy to drop ours or compare notes.
- Server-only varbits/varp 63740-63742 (our id range; see question 3 in #353).

**Release note.** Sheep Shearer and Romeo & Juliet are playable, with the progress values Quest Helper reads.

**Checklist**
- [x] The change compiles (`./gradlew build`).
- [x] Tests related to the change pass (`./gradlew assemble test integration`, `spotlessCheck`).
- [x] No documentation change needed.
- [x] No unrelated formatting or dependency changes.
- [x] Manual testing notes are under Tests above.

